@jaydo8421China is a multi-ethnic country from the start. Even Han is formed by ancient tribes. Even in ancient times, different ethnic live side by side in vast area of China. Like my family can trace back to Mongol, now we turn into Han. Han is just a combination that everyone assimilate into.  Your fantasy and false claim don’t even stand a chance internationally by professional scholars and historians.  The truth is looking back at thousands of history, Korean, and Korean is very weak, and never has any ability to defend itself. That’s the bitter truth. Koreans always need protection from someone, ancient time is China, now the US.  I don’t think you guys can survive and defend your country by Koreans only.  Without US, Korea Facing China, Russia, Japan, any one of them can eat you alive.  
I see Korean nationalist like to claim China is not China that sort of BS.  But truth is China is China, no matter which dynasty. Every ethnic you mentioned is all Chinese . Just to educate you, Chinese = Han, Mongolian, Manchu, Zheng, Tibetan, Uyghur, and many other ethnics.  China boarders Central Asia, Siberia, India, Southeast Asia.  China has been connecting with rest of the world since ancient time through silk roads. Ancient time, Persian , Arabs, Indian traders all came trading in China.  So Han people has many genetics.  Korean since ancient time is only isolated in Korean Peninsula.  
Now, come back to reality and understand geopolitics,  instead of fantasizing in dream world.  The world is now changing,  it’s China vs USA.  Don’t tell me mongol it’s powerful, or Manchu is powerful. Its pass history. They are now happy Chinese citizens. And don’t claim territory on the net, it’s useless.  If Korean wants land! Then declare war on China, or Russia otherwise, shut up.

@qazdrfvgy 兄弟？我们满族大部分居住在满洲，你们韩国人天天宣传满洲是你们韩国的领土，而韩国只有朝鲜族，根本就没有满族的生存之地，这不就是企图剥夺满族生存权吗？所以这就是你口中的的兄弟？ 真是令人震惊的逻辑思维啊 
其次，满族本来就是中国人，从唐朝时期满族先祖靺鞨建立的渤海国就是是唐朝藩属政权，黑水靺鞨也臣服唐朝，唐朝设立黑水都督府管辖，从那时候起我们就是中国的边境的少数民族，甚至建立清朝的努尔哈赤也是明朝的官员，我不是中国人难道是你们韩国人？
 反而倒是你们韩国人，仅仅因为汉人给你们赐名“朝鲜”，就声称自己继承中国古朝鲜，同时宣传中国东北少数民族高句丽政权是你们先祖，到底是谁在抛弃自己先祖掉头去认中国人当先祖啊？  请记住一点，你们不过是一生都未走出半岛的三韩后裔 。 中国内部的民族怎么争斗，也是中国内部的事，你猜猜看是谁臣服汉族几千年，臣服蒙古族几百年，臣服我们满族几百年，被日本殖民30年，被美国殖民到2026年的今天，到底谁是主人谁是殖民地，很难猜吗？我们都心知肚明
